sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard / SDK)
    participant Gateway as odh-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant KubeAPI as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as rest-service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Flight as flight-service<br/>8443/TCP gRPC+TLS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant Backend as Backend Data Source<br/>Various

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: REST API Request (Connection CRUD)
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>Bearer Token
        Gateway->>KRBAC: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (service-ca)<br/>Bearer passthrough
        KRBAC->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>X-Tenant-Id → namespace
        KubeAPI-->>KRBAC: Allowed
        KRBAC->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>X-Remote-User, X-Tenant-Id headers
        REST->>PG: TCP/5432<br/>TLS (rustls)<br/>Password auth
        PG-->>REST: Query Result
        REST-->>KRBAC: JSON Response
        KRBAC-->>Gateway: HTTPS Response
        Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,Backend: Flow 2: Arrow Flight Data Ingestion
        Client->>Flight: gRPC/8443<br/>TLS (service-ca)<br/>Bearer Token
        Flight->>KubeAPI: TokenReview<br/>(validates bearer token)
        KubeAPI-->>Flight: Token Valid
        Flight->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(tenant namespace check)
        KubeAPI-->>Flight: Allowed
        Flight->>PG: TCP/5432<br/>Connection metadata lookup
        PG-->>Flight: Connection Details
        Flight->>Backend: Per-connector protocol<br/>Per-connector credentials
        Backend-->>Flight: Source Data
        Flight-->>Client: Arrow RecordBatch stream<br/>gRPC/8443 TLS
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Backend: Flow 3: Connection Readiness Check
        Client->>KRBAC: HTTPS/8443<br/>Bearer Token
        KRBAC->>KubeAPI: SubjectAccessReview
        KubeAPI-->>KRBAC: Allowed
        KRBAC->>REST: HTTP/8080<br/>Headers
        REST->>Flight: gRPC/8443<br/>TLS (service-ca)<br/>SA token bearer
        Flight->>Backend: Per-connector probe<br/>Credentials from metadata
        Backend-->>Flight: Connection Status
        Flight-->>REST: Readiness Result
        REST-->>KRBAC: JSON Response
        KRBAC-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    end
